---
import EnlacesSociales from './EnlacesSociales.astro'

const año = new Date().getFullYear()

const focusClasses =
  'focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-yellow-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-gray-950'
---

<footer
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-violet-400/20 text-gray-100 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(139,92,246,0.12),transparent_42%)] bg-gray-950"
  aria-labelledby="footer-cercano-title"
>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-px w-28 bg-yellow-300 sm:w-40"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="container relative mx-auto w-full px-4 py-14 md:max-w-2xl md:py-20 lg:max-w-4xl lg:py-24"
  >
    <div
      class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(12rem,1fr)] md:gap-8 lg:gap-12"
    >
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-yellow-300">
            HABLEMOS DE TU PROYECTO
          </p>
          <div class="relative ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:hidden">
            <span
              class="absolute h-20 w-24 rounded-full bg-violet-500/25 blur-xl"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <img
              src="/logos/jd-knight-gold-light.webp"
              alt=""
              aria-hidden="true"
              width="80"
              height="80"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="relative h-20 w-20 select-none object-contain"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2
          id="footer-cercano-title"
          class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-5xl"
        >
          ¿Lo vemos juntos?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-300 sm:text-lg">
          Te ayudo a convertir una idea o un proceso complejo en una solución clara, sólida y fácil
          de mantener.
        </p>

        <EnlacesSociales layout="grid" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative hidden min-h-52 items-center justify-end md:flex" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="absolute h-28 w-36 rounded-full bg-violet-400/25 blur-3xl md:h-40 md:w-52"
        ></span>
        <img
          src="/logos/jd-knight-gold-light.webp"
          alt=""
          aria-hidden="true"
          width="288"
          height="288"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="relative h-auto w-28 select-none object-contain md:w-48 lg:w-56"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 border-t border-gray-800/80 pt-6 text-sm text-gray-300 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between md:mt-16"
    >
      <nav aria-label="Navegación secundaria" class="mx-auto text-center sm:mx-0 sm:text-left">
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 sm:justify-start">
          <li>
            <a
              class:list={[
                'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-yellow-300 visited:text-yellow-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200',
                focusClasses,
              ]}
              href="/">Experiencia</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class:list={[
                'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-yellow-300 visited:text-yellow-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200',
                focusClasses,
              ]}
              href="/projects">Proyectos</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class:list={[
                'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-yellow-300 visited:text-yellow-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200',
                focusClasses,
              ]}
              href="/about">Sobre mí</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <p class="mx-auto shrink-0 text-gray-400 sm:mx-0">© {año} Diego Fernández</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
